      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I found Luke from Sonnen to be the most honest salesman/advisor.Whereas other companies I contacted wanted to sell me a 3kW system, Luke asked me to find out what our average daily usage was first, and told me that whatever that would be, divide it by 3, and then buy the system to cover our daytime usage (1/3). For us, it turns out a 1.6 kW system would cover the daytime usage. We (with Luke) decided to go for something slightly more powerful, as the price difference wasn't too much: 2 kW.Sonnen sub-contract the installers, and they were extremely efficient and knowledgeable.The System has been performing extremely well, and as it is an average-good quality system it won't take 5 years to cover the cost. It will take 2 years.",
